hics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person horror experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon gameplay</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is only the demo version \u2013 the full game will include many more features, events, and terrifying encounters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910890/extras/69b67f243091f9db97cd5bc3e2bdf0ea.poster.avif?t=1771951108\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910890/extras/69b67f243091f9db97cd5bc3e2bdf0ea.webm?t=1771951108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910890/extras/69b67f243091f9db97cd5bc3e2bdf0ea.mp4?t=1771951108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["odwar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910890/eb9f5e998b179f79f09e55a1f14947adf6d0545e/header.jpg?t=1771951108","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3910890/1811705010/2e2665ce886a0c3c96d3d3d921a1d516dd1aa254/1759400291/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759400962","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3910890/1811705010/2e2665ce886a0c3c96d3d3d921a1d516dd1aa254/1759400291/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759400962","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st